{
  "id": "technostress",
  "term": "technostress",
  "definition": "Technostress is stress related to digital technology use that is linked to feeling less self-control, more emotional strain, distraction, and distorted thinking. In this context, it may lead people to use virtual environments to escape discomfort and, when paired with low perceived control, to show maladaptive online behavior.",
